    "media:imagetext": "FOR\nMR FAIR\nDC 78\nRESCE\nE PASS\nit to the hostess when\noard the plane\nDEST.\nDEN\nDEST.\nDEST.\nFLT. NO.\n3\nFLT. NO.\nFLT. NO.\nIMPORTANT!\n• ARRANGE FOR YOUR TICKET IN ADVANCE\nIt will save time... save standing in line...\nhelp you with your reservation. Continental's ticketing\nprocedures make it simple. Use the phone freely\nand order TICKETS BY MAIL, or arrange for airport\nor ticket office WILL CALL. Pay by cash, check,\ncredit cards, or Telegraphic Money Order.\nThere's TICKET DELIVERY too! The only charge is the\ncost of the messenger. Continental also offers an\nAIRPORT TICKET DEPOSIT SERVICE at stopover points\nto facilitate return or continuing reservations.\nRemember, to make sure there's a seat for you when\nyou want it, get your ticket in hand as early as possible.\n2006 009. 310.020",
